    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599960/extras/419160b7db6e1030b647f58104b7dbb6.avif?t=1694630679\" width=592 height=108 /></span><br><br>Aimee's Cafe is a cozy point-and-click adventure game where you play as Aimee, a lazy caf\u00e9 owner who suddenly has to solve the mystery of where all the sugar has gone. <br><br>Meet unique characters, solve puzzles, and find out who took the sugar for the sake of the Spring Wake Festival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599960/extras/b9418510826cc2c355a035c1ea3c4b2c.avif?t=1694630679\" width=592 height=108 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A whole cast of unique characters to befriend<br></li><li> Solve puzzles that may or may not advance your quest<br></li><li> Help a cat and a dog fall in love<br></li><li> Eavesdrop on townsfolk because you can<br></li><li> Do bad things maybe?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2599960/extras/4288e5d8381b6cafd5f29efbf5e8e521.avif?t=1694630679\" width=592 height=108 /></span><br>That's for you to find out",
